    "code_caution": "Two zoning amendments, Ord. No. 619 (2026-06-15) and Ord. No. 623 (2026-09-21), are not yet in the online code. They were not read, so they may change these rules. Ask the Township.",
    "checks": [
      "A 'temporary unit for relative (in-law suite)' may be added as an accessory use to a single-family dwelling (300-15B(4), added by Ord. No. 517 in 2011)",
      "The unit must be 'totally enclosed within the principal building', with an internal connection to the main home (300-15B(4)(a), (c))",
      "The main home must be owner-occupied (300-15B(4)(b))",
      "Only immediate family may live in it: parents, grandparents, children, grandchildren, siblings, aunts, uncles, stepparents and stepchildren (300-15B(4)(e))",
      "The owners record a covenant, approved by the Township Solicitor, that bars use of the property as two or more dwelling units (300-15B(4)(d))",
      "It reaches the districts whose use lists permit a single-family detached house with accessory uses: R-1, R-2, R-3, VP, YMU, CL, the planned community districts OSR-1, OSR-2, GCR and ARR, VCO (houses only in existing structures, one use per lot) and MH (conventionally built houses may be up to 40% of a mobile home development). In MH and in R-4 (single-family attached units only in buildings mixed with multifamily) whether the unit applies is not settled",
      "In ARR every household must include a permanent resident 55 or older, and no one 18 or younger may live there, except for example grandchildren staying less than 120 days a year (300-345A, 300-350G)",
      "No more than three accessory structures or uses on a lot, one swimming pool not counted. Together they may cover at most 3% of a lot up to 20,000 sq ft, or 2% of a larger lot (300-15E)",
      "No size limit and no extra parking rule is set for the unit",
      "R-1 and R-2 tables state lot area 'per dwelling unit'. Whether the in-law suite counts is not settled. The covenant suggests the Township treats the property as one dwelling unit",
      "A zoning permit is needed for any accessory structure or building (300-15D)"
    ],
